    <briefdescription>
<para>Represents a predicate at the <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_machine_function" kindref="compound">MachineFunction</ref> level. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The control flow a <ref refid="structllvm_1_1_target_instr_info_1_1_machine_branch_predicate" kindref="compound">MachineBranchPredicate</ref> represents is:</para>
<para>Reg = LHS <computeroutput><ref refid="class_predicate" kindref="compound">Predicate</ref></computeroutput> RHS == ConditionDef if Reg then goto TrueDest else goto FalseDest </para>
    </detaileddescription>
